<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Mark IV started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mark IV started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns confirmed it initiated coverage of Mark IV Industries Inc with an attractive rating.</p>
<p>-- said set a 12-15 month price target of $30.</p>
<p>-- said expects Mark IV to earn $1.72 a share in fiscal 1998 and $2.00 a share in fiscal 1999.</p>
<p>-- Mark IV gained 3/8 to 23-5/8.</p>
</text>
